      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Mayor has caused to be prepared and approved the details of the plan for such revisions and has agreed, through collective bargaining with a number of city-wide majority representatives to include certain terms in currently negotiated agreements consistent with such plan, to take effect on a date following the implementation of such plan;",
